# 统一文本文件行尾符为 LF，与 Linux 运行环境及服务器部署副本保持一致，
# 避免 CRLF 造满屏假差异。二进制文件显式声明，不参与转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.so binary
*.node binary
